        <p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-loose text-lg mb-8">空气炸锅是近年来厨房最火爆的小家电之一。它利用高速热风循环技术，用少量油就能制作出酥脆可口的食物。本文精选了10款2026年最受欢迎的空气炸锅。</p>
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-12 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-px bg-gold-primary"></span>产品对比表</h2>
        <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 rounded-xl border border-border"><table class="w-full font-inter text-sm"><thead><tr class="bg-cream"><th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-dark-bg">排名</th><th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-dark-bg">产品名称</th><th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-dark-bg">价格</th><th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-dark-bg">亮点</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-border"><tr class="hover:bg-cream transition-colors"><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="font-bold text-gold-primary">#1</span></td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Ninja Foodi Dual Zone</td><td class="px-4 py-3">$ 179.99</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-secondary text-xs">双篮独立控制</td></tr>
<tr class="hover:bg-cream transition-colors"><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="font-bold text-gold-primary">#2</span></td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">COSORI Pro LE 5Qt</td><td class="px-4 py-3">$ 89.99</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-secondary text-xs">性价比之选</td></tr>
