<tr class="hover:bg-cream transition-colors"><td class="px-4 py-3"><td class="px-4 py-3">4</td></td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Instant Vortex Plus 6Qt</td><td class="px-4 py-3">$ 119.99</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-secondary text-xs">6合1多功能</td></tr>
<tr class="hover:bg-cream transition-colors"><td class="px-4 py-3"><td class="px-4 py-3">5</td></td><td class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Dash Tasti-Crisp</td><td class="px-4 py-3">$ 49.99</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-secondary text-xs">入门级迷你款</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-12 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-px bg-gold-primary"></span>详细评测</h2><div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-8 mb-6"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4"><span class="font-playfair text-4xl font-bold text-gold-primary">1</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="font-playfair text-xl font-bold text-dark-bg mb-2">Ninja Foodi Dual Zone</h3><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★★</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-muted">|</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-gold-primary font-semibold">$ 179.99</span></div></div></div><p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">Ninja Foodi Dual Zone革命性的双篮设计让烹饪变得更高效。两个独立篮子可以分别设置不同的温度和时间，同时烹饪主菜和配菜且互不串味。Smart Finish功能确保两篮同时完成烹饪。</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-emerald-deep">优点：双篮独立控制</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-emerald-deep">优点：Smart Finish同步</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-emerald-deep">优点：大容量</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">缺点：体积较大</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">缺点：价格偏高</span></div></div><a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 btn-gold text-sm">在亚马逊上查看价格 →</a></div><div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-8 mb-6"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4"><span class="font-playfair text-4xl font-bold text-gold-primary">2</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="font-playfair text-xl font-bold text-dark-bg mb-2">COSORI Pro LE 5Qt</h3><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★★</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-muted">|</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-gold-primary font-semibold">$ 89.99</span></div></div></div><p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">COSORI Pro LE是5夸脱级别的市场领导者。预置11种烹饪程序，一键操作。数字触摸屏响应灵敏，温度范围80-205°C可调。非不粘涂层内胆易于清洗。</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-emerald-deep">优点：11种预设程序</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-emerald-deep">优点：易于清洁</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-emerald-deep">优点：性价比高</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">缺点：无双篮设计</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">缺点：噪音中等</span></div></div><a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 btn-gold text-sm">在亚马逊上查看价格 →</a></div><div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-8 mb-6"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4"><span class="font-playfair text-4xl font-bold text-gold-primary">3</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="font-playfair text-xl font-bold text-dark-bg mb-2">Instant Vortex Plus 6Qt</h3><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★★</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-muted">|</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-gold-primary font-semibold">$ 119.99</span></div></div></div><p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">Instant Pot家族的新成员，6夸脱大容量适合4-6人家庭。One-Touch Smart Programs支持六种烹饪方式。旋转烤架配件让烹饪更多样化。</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-emerald-deep">优点：6种烹饪模式</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-emerald-deep">优点：大容量</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">缺点：APP需订阅高级功能</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">缺点：操作略显复杂</span></div></div><a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 btn-gold text-sm">在亚马逊上查看价格 →</a></div>
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-12 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-px bg-gold-primary"></span>我们如何选择</h2>
        <p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-loose mb-8">我们测试了超过20款空气炸锅，评估维度包括：烹饪均匀度（使用红外热成像仪）、容量实用性、易用性、清洁便利性和噪音水平。所有产品均独立完成购买。</p>
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-12 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-px bg-gold-primary"></span>常见问题解答</h2><div class="bg-cream rounded-xl p-6 mb-4"><h3 class="font-playfair font-semibold text-lg text-dark-bg mb-2">Q: 空气炸锅真的健康吗？</h3><p class="font-inter text-secondary">相比传统油炸，空气炸锅使用的气体量减少80-90%，热量降低约70%。但高温烹饪仍可能产生丙烯酰胺等有害物质，建议搭配蔬菜一起烹饪。</p></div>
<div class="bg-cream rounded-xl p-6 mb-4"><h3 class="font-playfair font-semibold text-lg text-dark-bg mb-2">Q: 空气炸锅适合几口之家？</h3><p class="font-inter text-secondary">1-2人选择2-3夸脱容量，3-4人选择4-5夸脱，5人以上建议选择6夸脱以上或双篮型号。</p></div>

        <div class="mt-12 p-8 bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-primary/10 to-gold-light/10 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-gold-primary"><h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mb-4">最终判决</h2><p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">综合性能和价格，<strong>Ninja Foodi Dual Zone</strong>的双篮独立控制设计无可匹敌。<strong>COSORI Pro LE</strong>则以89美元的价格提供了顶级性能，是单口或两口之家的最佳选择。</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-6"><a href="#" class="btn-gold text-sm">查看最佳选择价格</a></div></div>
